# .env.example
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------
# Template for the environment variables this project needs.
#
# HOW TO USE THIS FILE:
# 1. Make a copy of this file in the same folder and rename the copy ".env"
#    (note the leading dot, and no ".example" at the end).
# 2. Replace the placeholder text below with your real API keys.
# 3. Never commit your real ".env" file to GitHub — only this example
#    file (with placeholders, not real keys) should ever be committed.
# -----------------------------------------------------------------------

